      "description": "Attach a source PDF, transcript, recording or other file to an existing page. Pass input.pageSlug, fileName (letters, numbers, dots, dashes and underscores), contentType, size (1 byte to 25 MiB), and lowercase sha256. PUT raw bytes to upload.url with upload.headers, then repeat the identical mutation for the verified receipt and organization-only downloadUrl."
